cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NextLA.jl in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "NextLA.jl"
abstract: >-
  Hardware-agnostic, datatype-flexible dense linear algebra in pure Julia:
  recursive GEMM, TRSM, SYRK, Cholesky and LU, tiled QR kernels, GPU backends
  through package extensions, and mixed-precision factorizations.
type: software
